  "description": "Debug full-stack issues in a running dev stack (docker + API + worker + frontend) by reading logs directly, writing API tests, and targeting user stories until they pass. Use this skill whenever the user reports a bug in a running local dev environment — frontend rendering wrong, button stuck, execution failed, clone broken, \"暂不可用\", blank workbench, 4xx/5xx errors. Covers: starting/monitoring the dev stack, reading API/worker logs, writing HTTP API verification scripts, identifying known bug magnets (progressProjection, clone fork fields, quota exhaustion), and iterating on fixes until user stories pass.",
